  "Cancelled in window (not counted): CANCELLED - K-12 Board of Education (2025-10-26); CANCELLED - Pastor Zoom (2025-11-05); K-12 Meeting - CANCELLED (2026-03-22); K-12 Meeting - Zoom Cancelled (2026-05-03); Pastor Zoom- Cancelled (2026-06-03); CANCELLED Pathfinder Camporee - FMC (2026-08-05); CANCELLED - Outdoor School - NLC (2026-09-08).",
  "Best calendar in the union: The Events Calendar plugin with public REST API and iCal feed; 340 entries Sep 2025-Jun 2027. Many entries are duplicated (the same event posted under two categories); duplicates were merged. Office closures and holidays were dropped.",
  "Strong prayer rhythm is visible on the calendar: weekly \"Dakotans Pray\" Zoom, a Monthly Prayer Emphasis, and a Dakota Prayer Retreat (Mar 2027).",
  "Administration-heavy calendar: executive committee, K-12 board, union and division meetings, school accreditation visits, MAP testing.",
  "No public evangelistic series is on the calendar for the window. The Dakota Dispatch (Nov 6 2025) and OUTLOOK (Jan 2026) report a Fargo church eight-night evangelism series held May 17-24, 2025 (out of window, 120+ guests, 25 renewed commitments) and a Mandan series; Dispatch (Nov 2025) reports early talks with It Is Written about a conference-wide evangelistic campaign. The State of the Conference (Sep 2026) reports investment in Bible workers and a church-planting pastor (group growing in Brookings, SD).",
  "Executive Committee (Dec 7 2025) reported plans to plant churches in Brookings, Sioux Falls, Fargo and Rapid City; 31 baptisms and 22 professions of faith in 2025 to that point. A Mandan church series titled \"Uncharted\" is mentioned in the Nov 6 2025 Dispatch but its text is not extractable (dates unknown).",
  "Dakota Dispatch archive is public only through Dec 18 2025 (Oct 23 and Dec 4 2025 PDFs have no extractable text); the quarterly Dakota Messenger archive stops at Jul-Sep 2025.",
  "The Pathfinder Camporee (Aug 5-9 2026) and Outdoor School at Northern Lights (Sep 8-11 2026) were cancelled."
